the wikipedia defines biology as  a branch of science that studies living  organisms  and several prominent sites define  biology as  the study of life  what is interesting is that no one  has been able to define the words life  and living  so  what is it that biologists  study more fundamental yet  is science about  studying  [Music]  if we look up the word science in  dictionaries and encyclopedias  we find the word study almost everywhere  the collins dictionary defines science  as the study of nature and behavior of  natural things  and the wikipedia tells us that  natural science is the study of the  physical world  social science is the study of human  behavior and functioning of societies  the oxford dictionary in turn defines  study as  the devotion of time and attention to  gaining knowledge of an academic subject  especially by means of books and the  collins dictionary says something  similar  to apply the mind to the learning  especially by reading  to study all night  what have you studied all night and  didn't understand anything  what if you studied your book all week  and got a zero on the test  do you qualify as a scientist  is studying just memorizing  regurgitating  is science like poetry  reciting mantras you repeat while  counting beads on your rosary  so the question you should ask is  whether science is learning by rote  which happens to be the way we learn in  school  which only perpetuates the status quo  and that might explain why contemporary  so-called scientists have no answers to  questions such as what is the underlying  mechanism of gravity  what causes a magnet to attract another  one  food for thought  [Music]
 

